{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj59pDqF7LDTyWPvJbYT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door shudders. Dust falls from its iron hinges. A deep resonance hums through the grain of the wood as tumblers unseen begin to shift...*\n\n*CLUNK.*\n\n*A seam of golden light splits vertically down the center, widening, spilling warmth across the threshold. The air changes — carrying the scent of old libraries, rain on stone, and something electric, like the moment before lightning.*\n\n*The door stands open.*\n\n*Beyond: a spiral staircase descending into soft amber glow, each step carved with a word in a language you almost remember.*\n\n*The door waits. It will not wait forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":152,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}